        "@value": "https://gallery7theatre.com/shows-training/anne"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "Matthew & Marilla request a boy from an orphanage to assist with farm chores. Instead, when they get the irrepressible Anne Shirley, their lives, and the lives of those living in the small community of Avonlea, are forever transformed. This inspiring and heartwarming Canadian classic celebrates community, family, and discovering one’s place in the world."
      }
    ],
