    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "A charming and heart-warming sequel to Pride and Prejudice, middle-sister Mary becomes the central focus when, during a Christmas family gathering at Pemberley, an unexpected guest inspires hope for an intellectual companion, greater autonomy, and the possibility of love. Brimming with romance, comedy and smart dialogue, this show will bring cheer to your Christmas season."
      }
