        "@value": "Journey back to Narnia! The Pevensie children join forces with Prince Caspian to restore peace and justice to the kingdom of Narnia. A story of courage and hope, this highly theatrical stage adaptation of the C.S. Lewis’ novel will inspire audiences of all ages!"
      }
