        "@value": "A former Polish nurse risks her own life to shelter a dozen Jewish men and women from the Nazi regime during World War II. Through her courageous and determined eyes, the remarkable true story of Irena Gut Opdyke comes to life in this hard-hitting and unrelenting story about the triumphs of the human spirt over devastating tragedy."
      }
