        "@value": "https://gallery7theatre.com/shows-training/g7-presents-golden-anniversaries"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "Every year since their wedding, Glen and Sandy have celebrated their anniversary at the same cottage on the lake for a weekend of romantic bliss. In the lead up to their 50th, however, their relationship takes an unexpected turn. A comedy-drama about marriage, memory and a long-term love for the ages."
      }
    ],
